Third-party source copied into this repository:

- third_party/typesetting/: 12 packages of github.com/go-text/typesetting
  v0.3.5 (Unlicense OR BSD-3-Clause; its LICENSE file is alongside), with
  our zero-allocation patch (third_party/typesetting/zeroalloc.patch,
  DECISIONS.md D23).
- text/delims.go: a copy of go-text/typesetting shaping/paired_delims_table.go
  (v0.3.5), Unlicense OR BSD-3-Clause.
